.TH MENUITEM 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
MenuItem \- One entry in a Menu: a label and the function to call when it is chosen
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqmenu.h\(dq
.ft B
typedef struct { const char *label; void (*action)(Engine *); } MenuItem;
.ft R
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
One entry in a Menu: a label and the function to call when it is chosen.
.SH FIELDS
.TP
.B label
text shown; must outlive the menu (a literal or a static buffer)
.TP
.B action
called with the Engine when chosen; NULL for a label that does nothing
.SH MODULE
menu (src/engine/menu/menu.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR Menu (3),
.BR menu_add (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
